    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a point in a discrete map coordinate system. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_point_map" kindref="compound">PointMap</ref> class stores the position along each axis as unsigned integers. It provides methods to get and set values, compare points, and serialize them for persistence or communication. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
